[l_english.EQUIPMENT_RANGED_BLUNDERBUSS]
Blunderbuss (Infantry)

[l_english.EQUIPMENT_RANGED_BLUNDERBUSS_desc]
If you find yourself in need of a weapon that’s as likely to hit your enemy as it is to hit your own hoof once in a while, the blunderbuss is the perfect choice. Just remember to have a sense of humor, you can always use it as an oversized conversation starter at social gatherings. After all, nothing breaks the ice quite like a blunderbuss.
§g“Aye, aye, captain!”§!

[l_english.EQUIPMENT_RANGED_BLUNDERBUSS_short]
Blunderbuss

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_RANGED_BLUNDERBUSS]
喇叭铳 (步兵装备)

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_RANGED_BLUNDERBUSS_desc]
如果您发现自己需要一种既能打中敌方，又能偶尔打中自己的马蹄的武器，那么“喇叭铳”就是您的不二之选。只要记住要有幽默感，您总可以选择在社交聚会上使用它来发表一个过度引人注目的开场白。毕竟，没有什么比喇叭铳更适合“破冰”。
§g“遵命，遵命，船长！”§!

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_RANGED_BLUNDERBUSS_short]
喇叭铳
